{"sourceUrl":"https://maize.sicau.edu.cn/info/1004/4039.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:33.263263+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://maize.sicau.edu.cn/info/1004/4039.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p>         <span>根据教育部相关文件</span><span>精神</span><span>和学校《硕士研究生管理办法》(校研发﹝2026﹞2号)</span><span>、</span><span>《2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法》（校研发〔2026〕37号）文件</span><span>要求</span><span>，</span><span>结合</span><a href=\"https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>《关于2027年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知》</span></a><span>要求，玉米研究所202</span><span>7</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生工作安排如下：</span></p><p><span>1、接收专业及名额</span><span>：</span><span>《</span><a href=\"https://yzb.sicau.edu.cn/zyml/zymls.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>四川农业大学硕士研究生招生专业目录</span></span></span></a><span>》</span><span>，直博生招生专业可在推免服务系统中查询。</span></p><p><span>2、凡具有推免资格且有意愿报考四川</span><span>农业大学</span><span>玉米研究所的推免生同学，</span><span>请于</span><span>9月18日-9月20日下午16:00前通过以下网址或二维码上传推免材料。其中，第12项“推免其他材料”需要上传两个文件：填写好的 附件1</span><span>《玉米研究所接收推荐免试研究生申请表》</span><span>和</span><span>相</span><span><span>关成果与奖励的证明（成绩单、简历、四六级成绩单、获奖证书等成一个</span><span>PDF文件）</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>材料收集表单地址：</span><a href=\"https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/</span></span></span></a></p><p>     <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://maize.sicau.edu.cn/__local/4/52/99/68D64CA3776196682C96D925544_8EDB5F67_C47F.jpg\"/></p><p><span>3、</span><span>9月2</span><span>1</span><span><span>日</span><span>9</span></span><span>：</span><span>00开始</span><span>，</span><span>登录中国研究生招生信息网填报志愿（网址：</span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></span></a><span>），并缴纳复试费（交费网址：</span><a href=\"https://op.sicau.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://op.sicau.edu.cn/</span></span></span></a> <span>，</span><span><span>用户登录选择</span><span>“校外人员登录”</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>登录用户名：</span><span>27+手机号；初始密码：身份证号码后6位</span></span><span>）</span> </p><p><span>4、</span><span>9月2</span><span>2</span><span>日起</span><span>，</span><span>我</span><span>单位</span><span>通过研招网推免服务系统发送复试通知，</span><span>并陆续进行复试，复试采用面试方式进行，具体复试时间地点另行电话通知；</span></p><p><span><span>复试考生务必加入玉米所硕士招生复试工作</span><span>QQ群：1125850214</span></span></p><p><span>5、9月24日起，</span><span>根据复试情况发</span><span>送待录取通知</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>、请各位考生确保学信网上注册的手机处于可用状态，</span><span>接</span><span>收推免服务系统发出的复试</span><span>通知及待录取</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>7</span><span>、其他未尽事宜，以</span><a href=\"https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>《关于</span><span>2027年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知》</span></span></span></a><span>为准，请务必认真仔细阅读</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>8、</span><span><span>已拟录取的推免生在安排好本科阶段学习的前提下，可自愿申请提前进入硕士阶段学习。为保障研究生学习进度，申请提前进入硕士阶段学习的推免生须在</span><span>10月10日(含10日)前提交申请（附件2）玉米所办公室。</span></span></p><p><span>9、</span><span>咨询方式</span></p><p><span>现场咨询：</span><span>四川农业大学成都校区科技园</span><span>1期</span><span>C</span><span>区</span><span>403</span></p><p><span>电话</span><span>咨询：</span> <span>028-86290912 </span><span>吴老师</span></p><p><span> 202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>18</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>四川农业大学</span><span>玉米</span><span>研究所</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"c023250c64ee37f32d915056fc8090fd4c1f103b3b32c58176805e849e989de8","textLength":914,"sourceSha256":"ab54f797d13eb402e68964c16b78586eec128930478bbb2ce7ebdbfff8dd7ab2","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件2 推免生申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习申请表.docx","url":"https://maize.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1789149530&wbfileid=DAD5632622FBEA4955DDD5F1E0B10BD2"},{"name":"附件1 玉米研究所接收推荐免试研究生申请表.doc","url":"https://maize.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1789149530&wbfileid=46C89B46EBF9A6BBFC292AA1D8514722"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e1152003c6abc497b71a","title":"2026年四川农业大学玉米研究所2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:33.263263+00:00"}
